 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2014-reserva-5-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Calcula \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\mathrm{tg}\\,x-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}{x-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Es una indeterminación \\(\\frac00\\). Aplico la regla de L'Hôpital<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si el límite de \\(\\frac fg\\) da \\(\\frac00\\) o \\(\\frac\\infty\\infty\\), es igual al límite de \\(\\frac{f'}{g'}\\), si este existe.</i>:</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\mathrm{tg}\\,x-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}{x-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\frac1{\\cos^2x}-\\cos x}{1-\\cos x}=\\left[\\frac00\\right]\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\frac{2\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}{\\cos^3x}+\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}{\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}\\]<p>Simplifico \\(\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\) (no es 0 cerca de 0, salvo en el propio 0):</p>\\[=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\left(\\frac2{\\cos^3x}+1\\right)=2+1=3\\]<div class='res'>El límite vale \\(3\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "lim",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2014-RESERVA_5.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2014-reserva-5-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=x^3-3x^2-x+3\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Halla, si existe, el punto de la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el que la recta tangente es \\(y=3-x\\).",
     "(1,75 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\) y la recta del apartado anterior."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La recta \\(y=3-x\\) tiene pendiente \\(-1\\). Busco dónde \\(f'(x)=-1\\):</p>\\[3x^2-6x-1=-1\\iff3x(x-2)=0\\iff x=0\\ \\text{ o }\\ x=2\\]<p>• En \\(x=0\\): \\(f(0)=3\\), y la tangente es \\(y-3=-1(x-0)\\iff y=3-x\\) ✓.</p><p>• En \\(x=2\\): \\(f(2)=-3\\), y la tangente es \\(y=-x-1\\neq3-x\\).</p><div class='res'>Existe y es el punto \\((0,3)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[x^3-3x^2-x+3=3-x\\iff x^3-3x^2=0\\iff x^2(x-3)=0\\iff x=0\\ \\text{(doble)}\\ \\text{ o }\\ x=3\\]<p>Entre 0 y 3 la recta queda por encima (en \\(x=1\\): \\(f(1)=0\\lt2\\)):</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='86.3,51.8 88.8,52.8 91.4,53.9 93.9,54.9 96.5,56.0 99.0,57.1 101.6,58.1 104.1,59.2 106.7,60.2 109.2,61.3 111.8,62.4 114.3,63.4 116.9,64.5 119.4,65.5 122.0,66.6 124.5,67.6 127.1,68.7 129.6,69.8 132.2,70.8 134.7,71.9 137.3,72.9 139.8,74.0 142.4,75.1 144.9,76.1 147.5,77.2 150.0,78.2 152.5,79.3 155.1,80.4 157.6,81.4 160.2,82.5 162.7,83.5 165.3,84.6 167.8,85.6 170.4,86.7 172.9,87.8 175.5,88.8 178.0,89.9 180.6,90.9 183.1,92.0 185.7,93.1 188.2,94.1 190.8,95.2 193.3,96.2 195.9,97.3 198.4,98.4 201.0,99.4 203.5,100.5 206.1,101.5 208.6,102.6 211.2,103.6 213.7,104.7 216.3,105.8 218.8,106.8 221.4,107.9 223.9,108.9 226.5,110.0 229.0,111.1 231.6,112.1 234.1,113.2 236.7,114.2 239.2,115.3 239.2,115.3 236.7,123.4 234.1,131.0 231.6,137.9 229.0,144.3 226.5,150.0 223.9,155.3 221.4,159.9 218.8,164.1 216.3,167.7 213.7,170.9 211.2,173.6 208.6,175.8 206.1,177.5 203.5,178.9 201.0,179.8 198.4,180.3 195.9,180.5 193.3,180.3 190.8,179.7 188.2,178.8 185.7,177.6 183.1,176.1 180.6,174.3 178.0,172.2 175.5,169.9 172.9,167.3 170.4,164.5 167.8,161.5 165.3,158.4 162.7,155.0 160.2,151.5 157.6,147.8 155.1,144.0 152.5,140.1 150.0,136.1 147.5,132.1 144.9,127.9 142.4,123.7 139.8,119.5 137.3,115.3 134.7,111.1 132.2,106.8 129.6,102.7 127.1,98.5 124.5,94.4 122.0,90.5 119.4,86.6 116.9,82.8 114.3,79.1 111.8,75.6 109.2,72.2 106.7,69.0 104.1,66.1 101.6,63.3 99.0,60.7 96.5,58.4 93.9,56.3 91.4,54.5 88.8,53.0 86.3,51.8' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='25.1,154.4 28.2,141.6 31.2,129.7 34.3,118.7 37.3,108.7 40.4,99.6 43.5,91.4 46.5,83.9 49.6,77.4 52.6,71.5 55.7,66.5 58.7,62.2 61.8,58.6 64.9,55.6 67.9,53.4 71.0,51.7 74.0,50.6 77.1,50.1 80.2,50.2 83.2,50.7 86.3,51.8 89.3,53.3 92.4,55.2 95.5,57.5 98.5,60.2 101.6,63.3 104.6,66.6 107.7,70.3 110.7,74.2 113.8,78.4 116.9,82.8 119.9,87.3 123.0,92.0 126.0,96.9 129.1,101.8 132.2,106.8 135.2,111.9 138.3,117.0 141.3,122.1 144.4,127.1 147.5,132.1 150.5,136.9 153.6,141.7 156.6,146.3 159.7,150.8 162.7,155.0 165.8,159.0 168.9,162.8 171.9,166.2 175.0,169.4 178.0,172.2 181.1,174.7 184.2,176.7 187.2,178.4 190.3,179.6 193.3,180.3 196.4,180.5 199.5,180.2 202.5,179.3 205.6,177.8 208.6,175.8 211.7,173.1 214.7,169.7 217.8,165.6 220.9,160.8 223.9,155.3 227.0,148.9 230.0,141.8 233.1,133.8 236.2,125.0 239.2,115.3 242.3,104.7 245.3,93.1 248.4,80.6 251.5,67.0 254.5,52.5 257.6,36.9 260.6,20.2 263.7,2.4 266.7,-16.6 269.8,-36.7' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='25.1,26.4 152.5,79.3 280.0,132.2' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='86.3' cy='51.8' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='92.3' y='45.8'>(0,3)</text><circle cx='239.2' cy='115.3' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='245.2' y='109.3'>(3,0)</text><text x='254.5' y='47.5' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='12'>f</text><text x='30.2' y='26.4' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='10'>y = 3 − x</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 115.3H294.0M86.3 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='35.3' y1='112.3' x2='35.3' y2='118.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='32.3' y='129.3' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='137.3' y1='112.3' x2='137.3' y2='118.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.3' y='129.3' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='188.2' y1='112.3' x2='188.2' y2='118.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='185.2' y='129.3' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='239.2' y1='112.3' x2='239.2' y2='118.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='236.2' y='129.3' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='83.3' y1='157.6' x2='89.3' y2='157.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='70.3' y='161.6' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='83.3' y1='72.9' x2='89.3' y2='72.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='70.3' y='76.9' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='83.3' y1='30.6' x2='89.3' y2='30.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='70.3' y='34.6' font-size='10'>4</text></svg></div>\\[A=\\int_0^3\\bigl[(3-x)-(x^3-3x^2-x+3)\\bigr]dx=\\int_0^3(3x^2-x^3)\\,dx=\\Bigl[x^3-\\frac{x^4}4\\Bigr]_0^3=27-\\frac{81}4=\\frac{27}4\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{27}4\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "tang",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "area",
