  {
   "id": "matematicas-2014-reserva-5-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el siguiente sistema de ecuaciones con incógnitas \\(x\\), \\(y\\), \\(z\\), \\[\\begin{cases}\\lambda y+(\\lambda+1)z=\\lambda\\\\\\lambda x+z=\\lambda\\\\x+\\lambda z=\\lambda\\end{cases}\\]",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Discute el sistema según los valores del parámetro \\(\\lambda\\).",
     "(0,5 p.) Resuelve el sistema para \\(\\lambda=1\\).",
     "(0,5 p.) Para \\(\\lambda=0\\), si es posible, da tres soluciones distintas."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&\\lambda&\\lambda+1\\\\\\lambda&0&1\\\\1&0&\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\\qquad A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}0&\\lambda&\\lambda+1&\\lambda\\\\\\lambda&0&1&\\lambda\\\\1&0&\\lambda&\\lambda\\end{array}\\right)\\]<p>Uso el teorema de Rouché-Frobenius<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Calculo \\(|A|\\) por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}0&\\lambda&\\lambda+1\\\\\\lambda&0&1\\\\1&0&\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+\\lambda+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+0+\\lambda^{3}\\bigr)\\]\\[=-\\lambda^3+\\lambda=-\\lambda(\\lambda-1)(\\lambda+1)\\]\\[|A|=0\\iff\\boxed{\\lambda=0},\\ \\boxed{\\lambda=1}\\ \\text{ o }\\ \\boxed{\\lambda=-1}\\]<p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda\\neq0,\\pm1\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=3=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\). <b>Compatible determinado.</b></p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda=0\\)<b>:</b> los términos independientes son 0 (homogéneo): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=\\operatorname{rg}A\\). \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\0&0&1\\\\1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\) tiene rango 2 (\\(\\begin{vmatrix}0&1\\\\1&0\\end{vmatrix}=-1\\neq0\\)). <b>Compatible indeterminado.</b></p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda=1\\)<b>:</b> \\(A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}0&1&2&1\\\\1&0&1&1\\\\1&0&1&1\\end{array}\\right)\\): las dos últimas filas son iguales y \\(\\begin{vmatrix}0&1\\\\1&0\\end{vmatrix}=-1\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\). <b>Compatible indeterminado.</b></p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda=-1\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\begin{vmatrix}0&-1\\\\-1&0\\end{vmatrix}=-1\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). Menor de \\(A^*\\) de las columnas 1, 2 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}0&-1&-1\\\\-1&0&-1\\\\1&0&-1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+1+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+0-1\\bigr)\\]\\[=2\\neq0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=3\\neq\\operatorname{rg}A\\). <b>Incompatible.</b></p><div class='res'>Si \\(\\lambda\\neq0,\\pm1\\): compatible determinado. Si \\(\\lambda=0\\) o \\(\\lambda=1\\): compatible indeterminado. Si \\(\\lambda=-1\\): incompatible</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(\\lambda=1\\) elimino la tercera ecuación (igual a la segunda). Con \\(z=t\\):</p>\\[\\begin{cases}y+2z=1\\\\x+z=1\\end{cases}\\Rightarrow y=1-2t,\\quad x=1-t\\]<div class='res'>\\(x=1-t,\\ y=1-2t,\\ z=t\\), con \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(\\lambda=0\\) el sistema es \\(z=0\\), \\(z=0\\), \\(x=0\\): las soluciones son \\((0,y,0)\\) con \\(y\\) cualquiera. Por ejemplo:</p><div class='res'>\\((0,0,0)\\), \\((0,1,0)\\) y \\((0,-1,0)\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "sistemas",
     "tipo": "disc",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "sistemas",
     "tipo": "res",
     "apartados": "b, c"
    }
   ],
