  {
   "id": "matematicas-2014-reserva-5-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean \\(A(-3,4,0)\\), \\(B(3,6,3)\\) y \\(C(-1,2,1)\\) los vértices de un triángulo.",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano \\(\\pi\\) que contiene al triángulo.",
     "(1 p.) Halla la ecuación de la recta perpendicular a \\(\\pi\\) que pasa por el origen de coordenadas.",
     "(0,5 p.) Calcula el área del triángulo \\(ABC\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El plano contiene a \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}=(6,2,3)\\) y \\(\\overrightarrow{AC}=(2,-2,1)\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\6&2&3\\\\2&-2&1\\end{vmatrix}=(8,\\,0,\\,-16)\\parallel(1,0,-2)\\]<p>Es de la forma \\(x-2z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(A\\): \\(-3+D=0\\iff D=3\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(\\pi\\equiv x-2z+3=0\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Una recta perpendicular a \\(\\pi\\) tiene como director el normal \\((1,0,-2)\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si la recta es perpendicular al plano, su dirección es la del vector normal del plano.</i>:</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":42,\"el\":68,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-3,4,0],[3,6,3],[-1,2,1]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"line\",[-1.0,0.0,2.0],[1.4,0.0,-2.8],\"#c2410c\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.4,0.0,-2.8],\"p\",\"#c2410c\",6,0],[\"pt\",[-3,4,0],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[3,6,3],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-1,2,1],\"C\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,0,0],\"O\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m14r5a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m14r5a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m14r5a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m14r5a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='247.0,87.2 152.6,246.0 141.5,78.3' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='86.0' y1='18.0' x2='26.0' y2='146.9' stroke='#c2410c' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='32.0' y='146.9' fill='#c2410c' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>p</text><circle cx='247.0' cy='87.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='254.0' y='81.2' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='152.6' cy='246.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='159.6' y='240.0' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='141.5' cy='78.3' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='148.5' y='72.3' font-weight='700'>C</text><circle cx='61.0' cy='71.7' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='68.0' y='65.7' font-weight='700'>O</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='13.3' y2='281.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='6.5' y='288.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='35.9' y2='279.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='37.1' y='287.4' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='264.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='265.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(\\begin{cases}x=\\lambda\\\\y=0\\\\z=-2\\lambda\\end{cases}\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Es la mitad del módulo del producto vectorial del apartado a)<i class='n' data-t='th'>\\(|\\vec u\\times\\vec v|\\) es el área del paralelogramo de lados \\(\\vec u\\) y \\(\\vec v\\); el triángulo es la mitad.</i>:</p>\\[\\text{Área}=\\frac12|(8,0,-16)|=\\frac12\\sqrt{64+256}=\\frac12\\sqrt{320}=4\\sqrt5\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=4\\sqrt5\\approx8{,}94\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
