  {
   "id": "matematicas-2014-reserva-5-5",
   "n": 5,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=x^2e^{-x^2}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Estudia y determina las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(1,25 p.) Halla los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento y los extremos relativos (abscisas donde se obtienen y valores que se alcanzan).",
     "(0,5 p.) Esboza la gráfica de \\(f\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Asíntotas verticales:</b> no hay, porque \\(f\\) es continua en \\(\\mathbb R\\).</p><p><b>Asíntotas horizontales.</b> \\(f\\) es par, así que el límite es el mismo en \\(+\\infty\\) y en \\(-\\infty\\):</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac{x^2}{e^{x^2}}=\\left[\\frac\\infty\\infty\\right]\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac{2x}{2xe^{x^2}}=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac1{e^{x^2}}=0\\]<p>\\(y=0\\) es asíntota horizontal en \\(\\pm\\infty\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si el límite de \\(\\frac fg\\) da \\(\\frac00\\) o \\(\\frac\\infty\\infty\\), es igual al límite de \\(\\frac{f'}{g'}\\), si este existe.</i>, y por tanto no hay oblicuas.</p><div class='res'>Única asíntota: \\(y=0\\) (en \\(+\\infty\\) y en \\(-\\infty\\))</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es derivable en \\(\\mathbb R\\): no hay puntos «problemáticos». Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[f'(x)=2xe^{-x^2}+x^2\\cdot(-2x)e^{-x^2}=2x(1-x^2)e^{-x^2}=0\\iff\\boxed{x=-1},\\ \\boxed{x=0},\\ \\boxed{x=1}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 356 108' width='100%' style='max-width:427px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H342' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>−1</text><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M260 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='260' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M43.0 40L79.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 11L79.0 10L77.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−2) &gt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M125.0 10L161.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 39L161.0 40L159.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−1/2) &lt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M207.0 40L243.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M234.0 11L243.0 10L241.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(1/2) &gt; 0</text><text x='275.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M289.0 10L325.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M316.0 39L325.0 40L323.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='301.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(2) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>Luego \\(f\\) crece en \\((-\\infty,-1)\\) y \\((0,1)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\), y decrece en \\((-1,0)\\) y \\((1,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. Alcanza máximos en \\(x=\\pm1\\), de valor \\(f(\\pm1)=\\frac1e\\), y un mínimo en \\(x=0\\), de valor \\(0\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>.</p><div class='res'>Crece en \\((-\\infty,-1)\\cup(0,1)\\); decrece en \\((-1,0)\\cup(1,+\\infty)\\). Máximos relativos en \\(\\left(\\pm1,\\frac1e\\right)\\); mínimo relativo en \\((0,0)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Es par, no negativa, toca el eje en el origen y tiende a 0 en los extremos:</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 170' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='20.0,123.9 22.2,123.9 24.3,123.9 26.5,123.8 28.7,123.8 30.8,123.7 33.0,123.6 35.2,123.5 37.3,123.4 39.5,123.2 41.7,123.0 43.8,122.7 46.0,122.4 48.2,122.0 50.3,121.5 52.5,120.9 54.7,120.1 56.8,119.3 59.0,118.2 61.2,117.1 63.3,115.7 65.5,114.1 67.7,112.3 69.8,110.3 72.0,108.0 74.2,105.5 76.3,102.7 78.5,99.8 80.7,96.6 82.8,93.2 85.0,89.7 87.2,86.1 89.3,82.4 91.5,78.8 93.7,75.3 95.8,71.9 98.0,68.8 100.2,66.1 102.3,63.8 104.5,62.0 106.7,60.8 108.8,60.3 111.0,60.4 113.2,61.4 115.3,63.1 117.5,65.5 119.7,68.7 121.8,72.5 124.0,76.9 126.2,81.7 128.3,86.9 130.5,92.3 132.7,97.7 134.8,103.0 137.0,108.0 139.2,112.5 141.3,116.5 143.5,119.7 145.7,122.1 147.8,123.5 150.0,124.0 152.2,123.5 154.3,122.1 156.5,119.7 158.7,116.5 160.8,112.5 163.0,108.0 165.2,103.0 167.3,97.7 169.5,92.3 171.7,86.9 173.8,81.7 176.0,76.9 178.2,72.5 180.3,68.7 182.5,65.5 184.7,63.1 186.8,61.4 189.0,60.4 191.2,60.3 193.3,60.8 195.5,62.0 197.7,63.8 199.8,66.1 202.0,68.8 204.2,71.9 206.3,75.3 208.5,78.8 210.7,82.4 212.8,86.1 215.0,89.7 217.2,93.2 219.3,96.6 221.5,99.8 223.7,102.7 225.8,105.5 228.0,108.0 230.2,110.3 232.3,112.3 234.5,114.1 236.7,115.7 238.8,117.1 241.0,118.2 243.2,119.3 245.3,120.1 247.5,120.9 249.7,121.5 251.8,122.0 254.0,122.4 256.2,122.7 258.3,123.0 260.5,123.2 262.7,123.4 264.8,123.5 267.0,123.6 269.2,123.7 271.3,123.8 273.5,123.8 275.7,123.9 277.8,123.9 280.0,123.9' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='109.4' cy='60.2' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='95.4' y='52.2'>máx</text><circle cx='190.6' cy='60.2' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='184.6' y='52.2'>máx</text><circle cx='150.0' cy='124.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='154.0' y='138.0'>mín</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 124.0H294.0M150.0 164.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='28.1' y1='121.0' x2='28.1' y2='127.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='25.1' y='138.0' font-size='10'>-3</text><line x1='68.8' y1='121.0' x2='68.8' y2='127.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='65.8' y='138.0' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='109.4' y1='121.0' x2='109.4' y2='127.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='106.4' y='138.0' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='190.6' y1='121.0' x2='190.6' y2='127.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='187.6' y='138.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='231.2' y1='121.0' x2='231.2' y2='127.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='228.2' y='138.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='271.9' y1='121.0' x2='271.9' y2='127.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='268.9' y='138.0' font-size='10'>3</text></svg></div></div>"
    }
   ],
