   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el punto \\(A(8,-1,3)\\) y la recta \\(r\\) dada por \\(\\dfrac{x+1}2=y-2=\\dfrac{z-1}3\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula la ecuación del plano que pasa por \\(A\\) y es perpendicular a \\(r\\).",
     "(1,25 p.) Halla el punto simétrico de \\(A\\) respecto de \\(r\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\((-1,2,1)\\) con \\(\\vec d=(2,1,3)\\). El plano es perpendicular a \\(r\\), así que \\(\\vec d\\) es su vector normal: \\(2x+y+3z+D=0\\). Contiene a \\(A\\): \\(16-1+9+D=0\\iff D=-24\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(2x+y+3z-24=0\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El plano del paso 1 es el del apartado a).</p><p><b>Paso 1. Plano perpendicular a la recta por el punto.</b> Como el plano \\(\\pi_\\perp\\) y la recta \\(r\\) son perpendiculares, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al vector normal del plano<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si el plano es perpendicular a la recta, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al normal del plano; por eso los coeficientes de \\(x\\), \\(y\\), \\(z\\) son las componentes de \\(\\vec d\\).</i>. Con \\(\\vec d=(2,\\ 1,\\ 3)\\), el plano es de la forma</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv 2x+y+3z+D=0\\]<p>Como contiene al punto \\(A(8,\\ -1,\\ 3)\\): \\(2\\cdot8+(-1)+3\\cdot3+D=0\\iff D=-24\\).</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv 2x+y+3z-24=0\\]<p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte.</b> Sustituyo las paramétricas de \\(r\\) en \\(\\pi_\\perp\\):</p>\\[2(-1+2t)+(2+t)+3(1+3t)-24=0\\iff 14t-21=0\\iff t=\\frac{3}{2}\\]\\[M\\left(2,\\ \\frac{7}{2},\\ \\frac{11}{2}\\right)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Punto medio.</b> \\(M\\) es el punto medio entre \\(A\\) y su simétrico \\(A'(a,b,c)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El simétrico \\(P'\\) cumple que \\(M\\) es el punto medio del segmento \\(PP'\\): cada coordenada de \\(M\\) es la media de las de \\(P\\) y \\(P'\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\frac{8+a}2=2,\\qquad\\frac{-1+b}2=\\frac{7}{2},\\qquad\\frac{3+c}2=\\frac{11}{2}\\]\\[a=-4,\\qquad b=8,\\qquad c=8\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":100,\"el\":21,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-5.164,8.536,8.598],[1.73,-5.253,8.598],[9.164,-1.536,2.402],[2.27,12.253,2.402]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[9.164,-1.536,2.402],\"π⊥\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[2.16,3.58,5.741],[2.388,3.409,5.646],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[2.388,3.409,5.646],[2.228,3.329,5.405],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[0.803,2.901,3.704],[3.197,4.099,7.296],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.197,4.099,7.296],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[2.321,3.66,5.981],[2.909,3.954,6.863],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[1.545,3.842,5.69],[2.133,4.136,6.572],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",6,10],[\"line\",[8.0,-1.0,3.0],[-4.0,8.0,8.0],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"pt\",[8.0,-1.0,3.0],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[2.0,3.5,5.5],\"M\",8,12],[\"pt\",[-4.0,8.0,8.0],\"A′\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m14r5b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m14r5b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m14r5b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m14r5b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='262.3,119.2 178.3,18.0 26.0,144.8 110.0,246.0' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='30.0' y='144.8' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π⊥</text><line x1='140.9' y1='128.1' x2='137.1' y2='128.3' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='137.1' y1='128.3' x2='140.4' y2='132.3' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='168.7' y1='161.4' x2='119.6' y2='102.6' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='125.6' y='102.6' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='137.6' y1='124.1' x2='125.5' y2='109.7' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m14r5b4d)'/><text x='129.5' y='105.7' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='151.6' y1='131.5' x2='139.5' y2='117.0' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m14r5b4n)'/><text x='145.5' y='127.0' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>n</text><line x1='46.1' y1='139.1' x2='242.2' y2='124.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><circle cx='46.1' cy='139.1' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='53.1' y='133.1' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='144.1' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='152.1' y='144.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><circle cx='242.2' cy='124.9' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='249.2' y='118.9' font-weight='700'>A′</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='8.2' y2='269.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='-0.3' y='272.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='21.2' y2='275.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='17.2' y='281.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='253.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector normal</text></g><g transform='translate(249.9,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(353.4,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>El simétrico de \\(A\\) respecto de \\(r\\) es \\(A'(-4,\\ 8,\\ 8)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(\\overrightarrow{AM}=\\left(-6,\\ \\frac{9}{2},\\ \\frac{5}{2}\\right)\\) es perpendicular a \\(\\vec d\\): \\(2\\cdot(-6)+\\frac{9}{2}+3\\cdot\\frac{5}{2}=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
